w when you come back to the game after a while. If you like the add-ons or changes that's for you to decide, but DIgital Extremes are known for listening to and implementing player feedback.", "timestamp_created": 1550791257, "timestamp_updated": 1745977780, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "49144078", "author": {"steamid": "76561198318679786", "personaname": "Zaron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/32156456423156/", "num_games_owned": 137, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 62756, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4173, "last_played": 1783975485, "avatar": "04d0029137072afb6c4511e854059c081d6b5b25"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really like this game plus i have no life so i did most of the quest in 3 weeks and im MR 6 and i already have umbra :)\nStill good game highly recommended but dont rush tru it like me", "timestamp_created": 1550780675, "timestamp_updated": 1550780675, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}